1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
KiddoVerse!

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:02,930
Shape workshop!

3
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:03,860
Let's go!

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,800
Beep boop! Shapes are all mixed up!

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,800
Come on, let's sort them out!

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,950
What shape is this? A circle!

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:19,950
Circle, circle, round and round!

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,950
Ball is a circle!

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,950
Cookie is a circle!

10
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,950
Orange is a circle!

11
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:29,950
What shape is this? A square!

12
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:33,300
Square, square, four sides!

13
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,950
Quilt is a square!

14
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:37,950
Window is a square!

15
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:39,950
Gift is a square!

16
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:43,950
What shape is this? A triangle!

17
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:47,800
Triangle, triangle, three sides!

18
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,950
Pizza is a triangle!

19
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,950
Tent is a triangle!

20
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,950
Sail is a triangle!

21
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:57,950
What shape is this? A rectangle!

22
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,800
Rectangle, rectangle, long and wide!

23
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,950
Door is a rectangle!

24
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:05,950
Book is a rectangle!

25
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:07,950
Flag is a rectangle!

26
00:01:07,970 --> 00:01:11,950
What shape is this? An oval!

27
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:15,800
Oval, oval, like an egg!

28
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,950
Egg is an oval!

29
00:01:17,970 --> 00:01:19,950
Lemon is an oval!

30
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:21,950
Leaf is an oval!

31
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,950
What shape is this? A star!

32
00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:29,300
Star, star, five points!

33
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,950
Starfish is a star!

34
00:01:31,970 --> 00:01:33,950
Badge is a star!

35
00:01:33,970 --> 00:01:35,950
Sticker is a star!

36
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:39,950
What shape is this? A heart!

37
00:01:39,970 --> 00:01:43,300
Heart, heart, full of love!

38
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:45,950
Card is a heart!

39
00:01:45,970 --> 00:01:47,950
Balloon is a heart!

40
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:49,950
Cookie is a heart!

41
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:53,950
What shape is this? A diamond!

42
00:01:53,970 --> 00:01:57,800
Diamond, diamond, shine and glow!

43
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,950
Kite is a diamond!

44
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:01,950
Gem is a diamond!

45
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:03,950
Sign is a diamond!

46
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:09,860
Where is the triangle?

47
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,950
Yes! It's the triangle!

48
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:17,860
Where is the heart?

49
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:19,950
Yes! It's the heart!

50
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:25,860
Where is the diamond?

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,950
Yes! It's the diamond!

52
00:02:27,970 --> 00:02:31,300
Circle arms! Triangle hands!

53
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,800
Star pose! Freeze!

54
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:38,800
Square walls, triangle roof!

55
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:42,800
Rectangle door, circle window!

56
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:46,800
Star on top, heart so sweet!

57
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:51,800
Oval pond, diamond kite! Ta da!

58
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:55,800
Bye bye, shapes! KiddoVerse!

59
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,950
Bye bye, KiddoVerse!

60
00:02:57,970 --> 00:02:59,910
See you next time!

61
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:02,250
Ask a grown-up to subscribe!

